# RescueAuth production Android signing secrets (Release Provisioning Step 1).
# The production private key must live entirely OUTSIDE the repo. Only the
# root/local production signing location is ignored; the `.example` template is
# committed. Developer Vault synthetic keystore fixtures are in-memory byte
# arrays in test sources and are unaffected.
